WEBVTT

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:27.980
All right...

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:30.260
Ramie!

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:31.950
Go!

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:42.470
That's it, Ramie.

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:44.140
Go on!

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:58.200
Ramie!

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:01.760
Ramie, great job.

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:04.200
You really are a genius!

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:09.910
I've found it...

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.770
an interesting-looking toy.

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:29.810
Lost

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:32.940
Tesaguri de sagashiteta
I've searched, groping

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:36.860
Tozasareta mirai no kotae nante doko nimo nai
The answer to a future that's been closed off

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:38.780
Tozasareta mirai no kotae nante doko nimo nai
Is nowhere to be found

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:42.120
Hashiru shoudou, ima kaidoku funou
The impulse to run, it's impossible to decipher now

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:43.830
Found

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:48.080
Kudaketa hazu no unmei o
A fate that was supposedly smashed

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:52.540
Mijuku na yume no naka de kikoeta kitanda
I've come to hear it within that half-formed dream:

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:55.380
Saigo made I'll be there for you
Until the end, I'll be there for you

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:58.470
Tachidomaranai, kono hari dake wa
It won't stop, not this needle

00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:01.800
Boku no asu o kizamu oto o tsukisasu
It will pierce the sound that engraves my tomorrow

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:03.720
Shinjitsu kara nigetara ima
If I run from the truth, then now...

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:05.430
Genjitsu ni mo maketara ima
If I lose to reality, then now...

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:07.770
Nani ga nokoru no?
What will remain?

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:09.980
(Nokoru no?)
(Will remain?)

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:12.360
Kazoekirenai kono kizu dake ga
These countless wounds of mine

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:15.820
Boku no kinou o zanzou to shite kataru
They tell of my yesterday as an afterimage

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:17.530
Unmei ga hodoketemo ima
Even if fate were unraveled, now...

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.360
Sonzai o kowashitemo ima
Even if my existence were smashed, now...

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:22.240
Boku no michi o yuku yo
I will travel my path

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:24.370
It's now or never

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:25.450
That is what they say

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:27.540
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:31.210
There will always be,
there will always be a way

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:32.380
That is what they say

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:34.550
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:38.050
There will always be,
there will always be a way

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:39.260
That is what they say

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:41.680
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:48.020
Atonement

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:54.200
So dreamy!

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:57.110
His big, puffy hair is so cute!

00:02:57.790 --> 00:03:00.340
That cool, handsome guy behind him
is dreamy too, huh?

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:03.530
Jeez, I can't decide which to go for!

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:05.810
Talk about a feast for the eyes!

00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:07.250
Way to go, Rook.

00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:09.200
You're totally popular.

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:11.450
I don't know about that.

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:14.210
Rook-Rook is fuzzy-wuzzy.

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:16.850
Sheeit, I don't believe this.

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:21.300
It wasn't that long ago this
guy was tryin' to kill us!

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.660
Quit dredging up the past already.

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:24.670
Ma'am!

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:28.130
Incidentally, what was it
you wanted to give Kaito?

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:31.270
That's what you came to Japan for, right?

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:38.450
It can't be!

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:39.710
This is...

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:43.220
A Replica Ring developed
by the Orpheus Order.

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:44.660
The latest model.

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:51.120
We found a plant beneath Saint Petersburg
that's still in operation.

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:55.300
We believe this Ring
is a more powerful type

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.610
than the one worn by Souji Jikukawa.

00:03:57.610 --> 00:03:59.630
Dude, for real?

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:02.240
This was a lot of work, huh?

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:04.390
Thanks, Rook!

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:06.860
No, it was nothing.

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:11.450
Well, I leave the rest to you, Cubik.

00:04:13.110 --> 00:04:17.590
I'm sure you can extract a lot of
information from this Ring.

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:21.110
The POG will back you
up one hundred percent.

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:23.610
Please do your utmost.

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:25.220
For Kaito's sake.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.900
Let's go, Bishop.

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:32.900
Yes, Master Rook.

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:37.470
Hey, Rook, you're already leavin'?

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:39.670
Yes.

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:42.380
Just stay here.

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:45.180
We're gonna have to
go head-on against the

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:47.320
Orpheus Order again at some point.

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:50.700
When that happens, if you
and me are together, then...

00:04:51.150 --> 00:04:53.010
I'd feel pretty secure.

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:55.590
Kaito, thank you.

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:58.860
But I can't do that.

00:04:59.350 --> 00:05:01.860
Why? Why the heck not?

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:06.770
Because I haven't yet
atoned for all my sins.

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:10.590
Rook...

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:27.140
That seems like a rather clever pup.

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:30.490
Nice to meet you.

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:32.330
I'm Melancholy.

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:33.520
And you are?

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:36.020
Oh, I'm Lotte.

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:38.330
Well, Lotte.

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:41.150
And this one's name is Ramie?

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:44.360
Oh, my!

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:46.410
Stop that, Ramie.

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:49.410
I'm sorry, he's not usually like this.

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:51.380
That's fine.

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:53.160
Let's be good friends.

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:56.160
Okay, Ramie?

00:05:58.790 --> 00:05:59.690
Huh?

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:03.080
Sure enough, that's one clever pup.

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:09.100
That's how he can even
solve mazes easily.

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:11.890
Huh? You saw that?

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:16.270
But you're right: Ramie's
a genius, for sure!

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:21.640
Ramie and I have been playing mazes

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:24.340
together since we were little.

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:42.860
I make them and Ramie solves them.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:03.060
Now, he can solve any
maze, no matter how tough.

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:08.570
Ramie's the smartest dog in Japan.

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:12.290
No, in the world!

00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:16.860
I get it, a genius dog.

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:19.290
That's a bunch of lies.

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:31.300
Rook Banjo Crossfield...

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:34.330
How I despise you!

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:38.530
If not for you,

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:42.450
I would never have been
driven from the POG!

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:46.190
Say, Uncle Her!

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:47.070
"Uncle"?!

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:51.070
What do you want?

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:56.190
I've got a super wonderful
present for you, Uncle.

00:07:57.450 --> 00:08:00.950
One that will send that kid
there straight to Hell!

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.440
It's perfect.

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:29.040
That's...

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:31.880
the Orpheus Order.

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:40.500
I'm honored you accepted
my invitation, Master Rook.

00:08:41.050 --> 00:08:43.460
I had no reason to refuse.

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:47.250
Now then, I will introduce your opponents

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:48.940
for this next game...

00:08:51.890 --> 00:08:54.290
Lotte and Ramie!

00:08:57.400 --> 00:09:01.130
You'd even put a Ring on this child?

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:06.070
Oh, my, she was the one who desired
the power of the Ring.

00:09:06.380 --> 00:09:07.450
That's right.

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:12.040
I'll show you that Ramie is a genius.

00:09:12.310 --> 00:09:16.170
And then you apologize
for making fun of Ramie!

00:09:16.980 --> 00:09:18.570
Sounds good.

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:25.830
Don't tell me, that dog...

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:28.080
So you've noticed?

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:33.460
That's right, your opponent is
none other than this dog!

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:37.840
Presenting the first dog in history
to wear an Orpheus Ring...

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:40.770
It's Ramie!

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:14.460
Master Rook, please be careful.

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:38.230
Welcome to the place of your death,

00:10:38.230 --> 00:10:41.310
Rook Banjo Crossfield.

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:42.620
What?!

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:44.700
Herbert...

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:46.620
So you're behind this, eh?

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:50.250
Your game this time is a
competition-style maze.

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:54.170
The designer was Lotte.

00:10:57.780 --> 00:11:02.070
I'll have Lotte go ahead
and wait at the end point.

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:06.560
Listen up, Ramie.

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:09.310
You have to prove to
them you're a genius.

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:11.380
You must win!

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:18.270
Oh, that's right, I forgot to mention.

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:21.910
This maze is rigged

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:24.910
so that whoever doesn't
solve it first dies.

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:27.110
Take a look.

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:48.200
A sheer drop...

00:11:49.940 --> 00:11:52.470
Falling means instant death, huh?

00:11:57.280 --> 00:11:58.610
Fog?!

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:05.240
The maze...

00:12:06.150 --> 00:12:06.960
It's disappeared.

00:12:08.960 --> 00:12:10.120
How cowardly!

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:15.630
Do you understand?

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:18.630
Do you know what you're doing?

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:22.480
Ramie loves mazes.

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:23.880
There's no way he'll lose.

00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:26.310
That's not the point!

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:29.980
Dammit! That Ring is twisting
the way she thinks.

00:12:29.980 --> 00:12:32.390
Oh, dear, is something the matter?

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:38.990
You're not saying that you,
who once achieved Phi-Brain status,

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:44.410
were unable to memorize a maze of
this level of difficulty, are you?

00:12:48.060 --> 00:12:49.910
Such is the power of the Ring.

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:54.750
Though made by a mere girl,
this puzzle is quite beautiful.

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:58.740
You'll be beaten by a dog wearing a Ring,

00:12:58.740 --> 00:13:01.410
and you will die an ignoble death, Rook!

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:08.110
Interesting, this is interesting.

00:13:08.310 --> 00:13:13.270
As always, you are rotten
to the core, Herbert.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:18.360
I'd rather not hear that from the likes of you,
Mr. Former Director.

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:19.730
Now then...

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:22.260
Let's play up!

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:24.990
Ramie, go!

00:13:36.140 --> 00:13:37.480
Come on, Ramie!

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:39.180
What are you doing?

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.500
Go faster already!

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:47.380
Which way next?

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:48.010
Right?

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:14.500
Master Rook, look out!

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:21.670
Oh, sorry, I forgot to explain.

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:26.960
This maze has four gates,
including the goal.

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:29.930
It's rigged so that when one of you
goes through a gate,

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:34.810
your prior route will utterly collapse.

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:36.680
Be careful, okay?

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:40.940
Now lose to a dog and die, Rook!

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:49.950
You did well.

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:52.950
But what about the next one?

00:14:54.690 --> 00:14:55.950
Good job, Ramie!

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:58.960
More! Go faster!

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:05.960
Come on, Ramie, run for it!

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:09.880
Run like your life depends on
it, or you really will die!

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:11.540
That's it!

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:14.470
Run more if you don't want to die!

00:15:15.210 --> 00:15:17.180
Can't you see it?

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:18.480
How your pup feels?

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:20.950
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:22.860
Ramie's happy.

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:26.230
Even now, he's having
fun solving this maze.

00:15:30.460 --> 00:15:34.280
Come on, now's not the time
for idle chatter, right?

00:15:34.730 --> 00:15:38.290
Ramie will go through
the second gate soon!

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:55.470
Master Rook...

00:15:56.780 --> 00:16:00.060
That you would lose to a
dog is so unsightly, Rook.

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:04.560
So, this is the extent of your skill without
an Armlet of Orpheus, eh?

00:16:05.490 --> 00:16:07.570
You have been rejected by the Rings,

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:09.740
and are unworthy to be my opponent!

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:14.820
Those Rings turn people
into slaves, nothing more.

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:17.170
I know that all too well.

00:16:20.340 --> 00:16:23.480
This maze has some sort of pattern to it.

00:16:24.340 --> 00:16:26.150
The way that dog moves...

00:16:31.620 --> 00:16:32.470
That's it!

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:46.480
Master Rook!

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:48.480
What is this?!

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:52.190
Oh, my, busted, huh?

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:54.790
This maze's pattern...

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:59.410
Every branch goes either left or right.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:02.920
And it's designed in such a way

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:07.420
that the correct route alternates
between right and left.

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:11.460
The dog understands that.

00:17:11.890 --> 00:17:12.760
It can't be!

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:16.220
Ramie, what are you waiting around for?!

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:18.970
Hurry up, you dunce!

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:42.520
Why?

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:44.410
Ramie is a genius, right?

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:48.260
There's no way he could lose.

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:49.170
So why?

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:53.100
Why?!

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:58.380
Why didn't you solve it faster?

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:01.140
You should be able to!

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:03.520
Hey, solve it!

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:05.390
Solve it, I said!

00:18:16.690 --> 00:18:18.190
Ramie?

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:24.060
Ramie, what's the matter?

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:25.450
What are you doing?

00:18:28.900 --> 00:18:31.180
Move! Come on, move!

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:32.630
Don't you understand?

00:18:32.940 --> 00:18:35.660
I'm telling you to solve the maze!

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:40.280
Ramie, you love mazes, right?!

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:46.100
He doesn't love them.

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:49.120
It's you that he loves.

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:51.840
He likes mazes because you make them.

00:18:59.190 --> 00:19:02.170
Ramie! Ramie!

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:06.340
Ramie, go!

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:17.130
Ramie took on the burden of the Ring,

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:20.170
kept running for your sake.

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:24.290
Jeez, we lost, huh?

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:27.890
Well, at least it helped pass the time.

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:30.790
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:19:31.630 --> 00:19:33.400
Aren't you going to solve the maze?! Hey!

00:19:34.220 --> 00:19:35.650
Bastards!

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:37.740
In that case...

00:19:40.870 --> 00:19:42.070
Master Rook!

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:52.070
Ramie!

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:19.360
Ramie!

00:20:32.300 --> 00:20:33.520
Made it.

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:40.710
I'm sorry, Ramie.

00:20:41.180 --> 00:20:42.500
I...

00:20:45.770 --> 00:20:49.720
From now on, you live for his sake.

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:54.390
That's what you must do as atonement.

00:20:55.320 --> 00:21:00.300
And as you keep on living,
you will have hope.

00:21:15.130 --> 00:21:17.000
Damn you, Rook!

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:19.000
Damn that mangy cur!

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:21.770
Wait, what was that "Uncle Her" earlier?

00:21:21.770 --> 00:21:23.010
I'm still young!

00:21:23.610 --> 00:21:25.130
Someone clean this up!

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:29.620
They've accepted you back
as director of the POG?

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:35.720
Yes, and I have to make sure that
no one else becomes a victim

00:21:35.720 --> 00:21:37.770
of those terrible Rings.

00:21:38.180 --> 00:21:40.260
I will return to the POG.

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:44.190
And I'll consider what I can do

00:21:44.700 --> 00:21:47.380
to crush the plans of the Orpheus Order.

00:21:48.270 --> 00:21:51.790
My atonement has only just started.

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:54.290
I see.

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:58.070
You can come back and
see us once in a while.

00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:01.050
Oh Cube, you little so-and-so!

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:04.720
Until then, please take care of Kaito.

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:09.890
Not that my Kaito would
ever lose, though.

00:22:20.450 --> 00:22:22.520
Ramie, go!

00:22:38.710 --> 00:22:40.050
Eiyuukidori
Playing the hero

00:22:40.050 --> 00:22:44.940
Itsudatte shinjita muteki no kankaku
A sense of invincibility you always believed in

00:22:45.550 --> 00:22:51.370
Tatakatte iru no wa chikyuu no tame nanka ja nai
You're not fighting for the sake of the world or anything

00:22:51.370 --> 00:22:54.160
Motto maipeesu de
It's for a more leisurely

00:22:54.160 --> 00:22:59.230
Sou, motto shoujiki na onegai no tame
Yeah, more straightforward request

00:22:59.600 --> 00:23:07.670
Nandotonaku kizutsuitemo tachiagare, hero
Even if you're wounded over and over, rise up, hero

